# title: Forward-start call
# category: Vanillas and digitals
# underlyings: 1
# source: Bouzoubaa & Osseiran, Exotic Options and Hybrids: A Guide to Structuring, Pricing and Trading, Wiley, 2010
# summary: A call whose strike is set three months from now, at the money on that date: the price of future volatility, not of today's moneyness.
#
# The strike is fixed on 2027-04-05 at 100% of the spot then; the option
# matures on 2028-01-04. Its value depends on the forward smile.

2027-04-05
    k = spot()

2028-01-04
    pays max(spot() - k, 0)
